{"id":"wb-6-262","name":"应国墓地","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"应国墓地","text":"应国墓地位于中国河南省平顶山市新华区薛庄镇北村西黄土岭，南北长2400米，东西宽100米，面积20公顷，为西周应国贵族、春秋楚国贵族和汉代平民墓葬。墓葬以昭穆制度为序，由南向北。大型墓均依次埋于中线上，中小型墓位于东西两侧，以东为主。\n2006年5月25日，中国国务院列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%94%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%93%E5%9C%B0","revisionId":93976365,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93976365","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8feaafed1dec1a22c9801c6e.jpg","title":"20260408_Goose-Shaped_Bronze_He.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260408_Goose-Shaped_Bronze_He.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/20260408_Goose-Shaped_Bronze_He.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​“匍”雁形铜盉，西周，1988年平顶山市应国墓地M50出土，河南博物院藏","width":320,"height":213}}